# NestedText v3 - mathml/ per-folder DETAIL pass (measured 2026-09-16)
# Source: cc-resources/.dtd-file-examples/mathml/ - 144 files, 1.4 MB.
# Listed inside mathml-docbook-xhtml11.nt; this is the dedicated folder
# file it deferred. Twelfth of the F18-rest detail passes.

folder-shape:
    two-versions: 2.0 97 files 866.2 KB, 3.0 38 files 552.5 KB
    dtd: 3 files 18.2 KB, ditabase.dtd plus mathmlDomain2 ent and mod
    transforms: pdfMathML.xsl and xhtmlMathML.xsl at root, catalog.xml, plugin.xml

version-consolidation-measured:
    > 2.0 to 3.0 shrinks 97 files to 38 while growing bytes per file: the
    > version consolidates modules instead of accreting them, the reverse
    > of the DITA 188-to-656 curve. Both directions exist in the corpus;
    > growth is a choice per release, never a law.

transform-pair:
    > pdfMathML.xsl and xhtmlMathML.xsl render the same vocabulary to
    > print and to hypertext from one source: the smallest two-output
    > precedent beside lwdita's conductor pair.

release-binding:
    > Stream 17 (429-file tree): the 97-to-38 consolidation is the
    > precedent that a generated tree may shrink across versions; count
    > emissions, never assume growth. Stream 9 (transforms): the pair
    > joins html2dita as the round-trip witnesses.
